-| --- | ---: | --- | ---: | --- | ---: | ---: |
-| `gsm8k` | 3 | `flexible-extract` | 5 | `exact_match` | 0.8992 | 0.0083 |
-| `gsm8k` | 3 | `strict-match` | 5 | `exact_match` | 0.8453 | 0.0100 |
